chat.nexustech.digitalmine.build=Digital Miner: build a solid 3 wide x 2 high x 3 deep structure. Put the controller at the front center of the base, button facing out; fill the other 17 blocks with Digital Mine Casings.
chat.nexustech.nuclear.build=Reactor: build a solid 3 wide x 5 high x 3 deep structure. Put the controller at the front center of the base, button facing out; put the core in the center of layer 3 (counting from the base). Fill the other 43 blocks with Nuclear Casings.

